## Color and Opacity read three floats on a renderer that records no ColorSamples, each
## followed by a Sphere so a mis-counted read desyncs the next parse. Not third-party.
Display "colorsamples_fallback.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 16 16 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Color 0.25 0.5 0.75
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
Opacity 1 1 1
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
